        <div class="about-text about-text--full">
            <h2>Off Screen</h2>
            <p>When I'm not working, I try to get as far from a screen as I reasonably can. Most of that time goes to the <strong>gym</strong>, a small <strong>garden</strong> I'm slowly getting better at not killing, and an ongoing obsession with <strong>fermentation</strong> that's been running for a few years now &mdash; sourdough, kombucha, and whatever jar of kimchi or shrub is currently taking over the kitchen counter. There's something about a process you can't rush or debug your way through, one that just needs time and the right conditions and otherwise leaves you alone, that's a good counterweight to a day spent writing code. I've killed more batches than I'd like to admit, which I've decided is just part of the process rather than a reason to stop.</p>

